The above covers this package's own source. It does not cover the compiled
artifact it ships: `swift_fmt.wasm.br` embeds swift-format, swift-syntax,
swift-markdown and the Swift standard library and Foundation (all Apache-2.0
with the Runtime Library Exception), swift-cmark (BSD-2-Clause), and statically
links wasi-libc (Apache-2.0-with-LLVM-exception / MIT).

Every one of those is permissive and asks only for attribution. The notices, the
full texts, and one known gap in them are in `licenses/NOTICE.md`.
